title: Several consoles at once, of several kinds: three servers in three consoles keep their own output, the list beside them marks the one that printed and the one whose server crashed, the kinds menu and a console's own menu open, a split shows two side by side, a console moves to a card of its own, one with a server running asks before it ends, closing the app ends every shell with what it started, and the next start brings the consoles back by name
folders: rust-small
limit: 170
expect-log: console: .*bash.* in .*rust-small
expect-log: console: .*powershell.* in .*rust-small
expect-log: console: .*cmd.* in .*rust-small
expect-log: script: console tab 1 shows 'alpha-'
expect-log: script: console tab 2 shows 'beta-'
expect-log: script: console tab 3 shows 'about'
expect-log: script: console tab 1 does not show 'beta-'
expect-log: script: console tab 2 does not show 'alpha-'
expect-log: script: console tab 1 \(current\) "alpha server" card 0 .* busy true news false broke false ended false commands \d failed 0
expect-log: script: console tab 2 "node -e .*beta.*" card 0 .* busy true news true broke false
expect-log: script: console tab 3 "rust-small" card 0 .* busy false news true broke true ended false commands 1 failed 1
expect-log: script: console tab 3 \(current\) "alpha server" card [1-9][0-9]* .* busy true
expect-log: console: node -e .*beta.* ended
expect-log: script: console tab \d "Command Prompt split" card 0 group \d+ busy false
again-expect-log: script: console tab \d+ .*"alpha server" card [1-9][0-9]* .* busy false .* cwd .*rust-small
again-expect-log: script: console tab \d+ .*"Command Prompt split" card 0
again-expect-log: console: .*bash.* in .*rust-small
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: console: .* did not start
forbid-log: is not tied to the app
absent-process: cc-qa-server

wait 3000
console node -e "let n=0,t=setInterval(()=>console.log('alpha-'+(++n)),700)" cc-qa-server-a
wait 2500
term rename alpha server
term new powershell
wait 5000
console node -e "let n=0,t=setInterval(()=>console.log('beta-'+(++n)),900)" cc-qa-server-b
wait 2500
term new bash
wait 3500
console echo about to crash && node -e "setTimeout(()=>process.exit(7),5000)" cc-qa-server-c
wait 1200
term front 1
wait 1500
mark a-three-consoles-the-first-in-front
wait 500
term has 1 alpha-
term has 2 beta-
term has 3 about
term has 1 beta-
term has 2 alpha-
wait 6000
term report
mark b-news-and-a-crash-marked-in-the-list
wait 500
term menu new
wait 900
mark c-the-kinds-of-console
wait 500
term page split
wait 900
mark d-split-with-a-kind
wait 500
term menu close
term menu more
wait 900
mark e-the-more-menu
wait 500
term menu close
term front 3
wait 1200
mark f-the-crashed-one-with-its-red-mark
wait 500
term split cmd
wait 4000
term rename Command Prompt split
wait 800
mark g-split-with-the-command-prompt
wait 500
term menu tab 1
wait 900
mark h-a-console-menu
wait 500
term page colour
wait 800
mark i-its-colours
wait 500
term menu close
term front 1
term colour 2
term icon server
term kill 2
wait 1200
mark j-asked-before-ending-a-server
wait 500
answer End
wait 1500
term front 1
term tocard
wait 2500
term report
mark k-a-card-of-its-own
wait 500
quit

=== again
wait 6000
term report
mark restored
wait 500
quit
